golangci-lint source: errorlint differs in severity
rule         value  options  severity
go.errors.1  -      -        error
go.errors.2  -      -        warning

Resolve each in one of three ways
split the entry: give each rule an entry of its own, since different options are
usually different entries
rebind one rule to another entry or value: gragas rebind
declare a conflicts relation on both rules and record a decision that names the
winning binding: gragas decision new

